// Test: spec_compliance/statements/scope005_screen_state_valid
// Grammar: screen_block, state_block
// Semantic: SCOPE005 — Access within the owning screen must be accepted
// Updated: screen functions are scoped under the screen name (Screen.fn);
//   calls from outside the screen use the qualified name.
